{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a strategy game where you use your available actions each turn to construct buildings and manage resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of the game is to rule your kingdom for 100 years by maintaining a careful balance between buildings that consume resources to produce more and those that generate fewer resources but require no upkeep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your kingdom grows, you will gain more actions, but a larger population will demand more food and happiness. Meanwhile, enemy nations will become increasingly ambitious over time, threatening your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">if even one of your key resources, food, happiness, or national defense, runs out, your kingdom will soon fade into history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, with your wise leadership, your kingdom can endure hardships and disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your people with benevolence and peace, and guide your kingdom to prosperity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566590?t=1742465996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566590?t=1742465996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566590/bf585dbe7d24d855591b78538b55bb3bc762f89e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742465996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566590/bf585dbe7d24d855591b78538b55bb3bc762f89e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742465996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a strategy game where you use your available actions each turn to construct buildings and manage resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of the game is to rule your kingdom for 100 years by maintaining a careful balance between buildings that consume resources to produce more and those that generate fewer resources but require no upkeep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your kingdom grows, you will gain more actions, but a larger population will demand more food and happiness. Meanwhile, enemy nations will become increasingly ambitious over time, threatening your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">if even one of your key resources, food, happiness, or national defense, runs out, your kingdom will soon fade into history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, with your wise leadership, your kingdom can endure hardships and disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your people with benevolence and peace, and guide your kingdom to prosperity.</p>","developers":["Dersty"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566590/a21edaf7c4d6002bc17e956c2bd6a19784611ca9/header.jpg?t=1742465996","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108631,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108631/movie480.mp4?t=1741295550","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108631/movie_max.mp4?t=1741295550"},"name":"gamePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108631/4c8379be2281af3eac8aac20adb1cc2bf8d742f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741295550","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108631/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741295550","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108631/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741295550"}}],"name":"One Hunread-Year Kingdom","package_groups":[{"descr